    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This is a nicely presented 62 sqm ground floor apartment in the ever-popular development of Melrose Court.\nLiving here you have very easy access to all that Wexford Town has to offer, and all from the safety of this gated development.\nNo. 42 offers a living/dining room that opens into the kitchen area, one family bathroom and two bedrooms. There are also two handy store areas off the rear corridor.\nTo the back is a patio area of some 4m x 2.7m, accessed from the larger second bedroom.\nElectric heating, built 1997, Management Fee approx 960 per annum, gate access (mobile number required). Ground floor apartments allow for some storage under the stairs outside."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 1.6m x 1.6m\nwith laminate flooring\n\nLiving/Dining - 6m x 3.8m\nwith laminate flooring and large double window to the front (SW facing). Opens into the kitchen area\n\nKitchen - 2.3m x 2.2m\nwith laminate flooring, waist and eye level units, tiled splashback\n\nRear Corridor - 3m x 2.1m and 1.8m x 1.1m\nL shaped area with laminate flooring\n\nStorage space - 1m x 0.8m\nshelved\n\nHot-press - 1m x 0.8m\nwith water tank - shelved\n\nShower Room - 2.2m x 1.7\nfully tiled with WC, WHB and mains shower\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.9m x 3.1m\nwith laminate flooring, patio door to rear seating area/patio\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.7m x 2.7m\nwith laminate flooring"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Ground floor 62 sqm apartment </li><li>Large open plan living/dining area into open kitchen</li><li>Two bedrooms, one bathroom</li><li>Rear terrace accessed from main bedroom</li><li>A short stroll to Wexford Town's Main Street</li><li>Gated development</li><li>Management fee 960 per annum</li></ul>"
      },
      {
